\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"delete this ideal,\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"be obedient to your master, okay?\\nmua\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"But…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Sigh… little girls\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Maybe I’ve already forever lost the ability to chatter and make noise together with the people I know\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"And now, what can be said?\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"You SHOULD know what Elihuso is—\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"a cold-blooded MONSTER\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"who never apologizes,\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"never accepts apologies,\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"stops at nothing,\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"keeps no attachments\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Since the beginning of 2025, Elihuso had been tormented by stubborn insomnia. She had tried many medications, yet it was hard to obtain true peace. Later, she tried medications that seemed to her more effective, but also more dangerous.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"…like sinking to the bottom of the water…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"It hurts…\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"On the night of July 15, 2025, under multiple complex factors, after using an overdose of medication, Elihuso suffered a sudden cardiopulmonary arrest. Although people around her promptly performed resuscitation and sent her to the hospital, it was no more than temporarily catching hold of a wisp of her lingering soul.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Perhaps everything had long been decided, only that this day came too suddenly.\\nNearly three years of agonizing torment had turned her into a wandering spirit in this world,\\nand every lamp of hope was snuffed out one by one…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Who was it you wanted to go and play with…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"The ones who promised to be together forever\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Waiting for you\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Or waiting for me\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"3-carboxy-3-hydroxypentanedioic acid\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"shattered glass…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Elihuso’s condition is not good, emergency\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"It might be the threshold of death\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Perhaps this is… the last goodbye\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"At Youfangqiao, without warning, the wind picked up for no apparent reason, and heavy rain began to fall.\\nPerhaps someone was crying; perhaps someone was sad.\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I love you\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"but buried deep in my heart\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"When you hate me, when you forget me\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"is when I have finally succeeded\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"Once, several friends tried through various means to make her stop using the dangerous drugs, but her obsession was set. The safety line she had drawn for herself was in the end also ruthlessly abandoned by her…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.blockquote,null,\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"You’re all so stupid\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"If you knew why Elihuso calls you an idiot, you wouldn’t be an idiot\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"I should not develop any intimate relationships…\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Don’t get emotional over a disposable thing…\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"If you can’t figure it out, then take your time…\",Vue.h(_components.br),\"\\n\",\"Be good, be obedient, take the medicine, okay?\"),\"\\n\"),\"\\n\",Vue.h(_components.p,null,\"“Even though we always awaited the 